ator source logging for per-source debug by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5554\r\n* Lukem ts/update digitaloceanv2 detector by @lukem-ts in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5545\r\n* Add upsert_error to AWSSecretsManager source metadata by @Ahmer-Zuberi in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5566\r\n* Make result ordering more deterministic and scope dedupe to the job by @LavishGent in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5540\r\n* only treat HubSpot MISSING_SCOPES 403s as live tokens by @jordanTunstill in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5582\r\n* feat(detectors): add Baseten API key detector by @sp3nx0r in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5484\r\n* [chore] Correct NewWebhookCustomRegex doc comment by @mcastorina in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5249\r\n* Saucelabs: verify via identity endpoint so proxy 403s aren't reported as live by @jordanTunstill in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5581\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Ahmer-Zuberi made their first contribution in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5566\r\n* @LavishGent made their first contribution in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5540\r\n* @sp3nx0r made their first contribution in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5484\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/compare/v3.99.9...v3.100.0\nTo install Bun v1.4.5\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://bun.com/install | bash\n# or you can use npm\n# npm install -g bun\n```\n\nWindows:\n```bash\npowershell -c \"irm bun.com/install.ps1|iex\"\n```\n\nTo upgrade to Bun v1.4.5:\n```bash\nbun upgrade\n```\n\n### [Read Bun v1.4.5's release notes on Bun's blog](https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.4.5)\n\n### Thanks to 3 contributors!\n\n- [@dylan-conway](https://github.com/dylan-conway)\n- [@Jarred-Sumner](https://github.com/Jarred-Sumner)\n- [@ro