[2026-11-20T14:38:45.742Z] [STDERR] ## What's Changed
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.744Z] [STDERR] ## Subscribe to GitHub Event Streams with `gh event` (preview)
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.754Z] [STDERR] The new `gh event` command set lets agents, integrations, and scripts wait for pull request changes instead of polling GitHub:
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.756Z] [STDERR] ```shell
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.758Z] [STDERR] # Wait for a review event
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.761Z] [STDERR] gh event listen --resource https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/NUMBER --event com.github.pull_request.review.submitted.v1 --timeout 30m
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.768Z] [STDERR] # Wait for a check suite completion event
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.771Z] [STDERR] gh event listen --resource https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/NUMBER --event com.github.pull_request.check_suite.status.changed.v1 --jq .data.conclusion
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.773Z] [STDERR] # List active event subscriptions
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.775Z] [STDERR] gh event subscription list
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.778Z] [STDERR] ```
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.781Z] [STDERR] By default, `gh event listen` exits after the first event. Use `--count` to wait for several events or `--follow` to keep listening. Events are printed as CloudEvent JSON objects, with `data.api_url` pointing to the resource that changed.
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.784Z] [STDERR] Supported events include submitted reviews, pull request state and head changes, merge conflicts, and completed check suites. The `subscription create`, `list`, `view`, and `delete` commands manage subscriptions directly.
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.786Z] [STDERR] > [!NOTE]
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.789Z] [STDERR] > GitHub Event Streams is in preview. [Join the wait list](https://gh.io/event-streams-signup), read the [announcement](https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-event-streams-is-now-in-preview), or see the [Event Streams documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/integrations/how-tos/using-github-event-streams).
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.792Z] [STDERR] ## What's Changed
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.794Z] [STDERR] ### ✨ Features
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.796Z] [STDERR] * Add a server-sent events reader and Event Subscriptions API client by @babakks in [#15071](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15071)
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.798Z] [STDERR] * Add `gh event listen` to wait for pull request events without polling by @babakks in [#15072](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15072)
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.800Z] [STDERR] * Add `gh event subscription list` by @babakks in [#15073](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/15073)
[2026-11-20T14:38:45.802Z] [STDERR] * Add `gh event subscription create` by @babakks in [#15074](https://git
