[2026-11-20T14:47:00.819Z] [STDERR] # Artifact SDK compatibility
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.823Z] [STDERR] This action keeps the official `@actions/artifact` client for authentication,
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.826Z] [STDERR] immutable artifact IDs, digests and transport. Scoped npm overrides pin the
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.829Z] [STDERR] SDK's original `unzip-stream` 0.3.4 and replace `archiver-utils`' deprecated
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.831Z] [STDERR] glob 10.5.0 with glob 14.0.6, which preserves the only API it uses,
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.832Z] [STDERR] `glob.sync`.
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.833Z] [STDERR] Downloads use the SDK's documented `skipDecompress` option and pass the digest
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.835Z] [STDERR] recorded at upload time as `expectedHash`, so the SDK still verifies every
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.837Z] [STDERR] downloaded archive. `zip.js` 2.25.0 then extracts it. The SDK's own reader,
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.838Z] [STDERR] unzip-stream, constructs deprecated `Buffer` instances; zip.js has no runtime
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.841Z] [STDERR] dependencies and supports ZIP64 and streamed decompression.
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.844Z] [STDERR] ## Adapter inventory
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.848Z] [STDERR] `extract.mjs` implements the download/extraction adapter. All behavior used by
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.851Z] [STDERR] this action is implemented and tested:
[2026-11-20T14:47:00.853Z] [STDERR] | Contract                                  | Implementation and verification                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
